  "phrases": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "text": "A bag of chips is mostly not chips, and the empty part is not air.",
      "start": 0.088,
      "end": 3.348,
      "wordRange": [
        0,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oxygen",
      "text": "Air is a fifth oxygen, and oxygen turns the oil in a chip rancid within days.",
      "start": 3.649,
      "end": 7.876,
      "wordRange": [
        15,
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nitrogen",
      "text": "So the bag gets flushed with nitrogen, which is inert and does nothing to food, and the oxygen inside drops to almost nothing.",
      "start": 8.215,
      "end": 13.975,
      "wordRange": [
        31,
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "freshness",
      "text": "That is the freshness half.",
      "start": 14.239,
      "end": 15.311,
      "wordRange": [
        54,
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cushion",
      "text": "The other half is that chips are fragile and get stacked, dropped and driven across a country, so the gas is also a pillow.",
      "start": 15.559,
      "end": 20.815,
      "wordRange": [
        59,
        82
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff",
      "text": "You are buying a cushion that doubles as a preservative.",
      "start": 21.075,
      "end": 23.129,
      "wordRange": [
        83,
        92
      ]
    }
  ],
